## Why This Question Is Asked
This question assesses the ability to design multi-tenant security architecture with data minimization and auditability in a regulated banking environment.

## Key Concepts
- Policy engines per tenant (RBAC/ABAC)
- Verifiable audit logs using Merkle trees
- Token-based authorization signed by KMS
- Tenant isolation and data minimization
- Latency targets and fault tolerance

